            "text": "{\"model\":\"claude-haiku-5-5\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"What is the weather in Tokyo? Use get_weather, then answer in one short sentence. Then solve, reasoning it through first: a train leaves at 09:47 and travels 283 km at 74 km/h; when does it arrive, to the minute?\"}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"I'm going to look up the Tokyo weather with get_weather first. The addendum in the system message is just an operator reference list meant for when it's asked for, so it doesn't bear on this. Next I'll work out the train arrival time from the 283 km distance at 74 km/h, which comes to roughly 3 hours and 49 minutes.\\n\\nI'm verifying the arrival time: 283 km at 74 km/h works out to about 3 hours 49.5 minutes, so departing at 09:47 puts arrival at 13:36. Making the tool call now.\\n\\n\",\"signature\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_018BwtUHv7ZJLFNgkk5U2htV\",\"name\":\"get_weather\",\"input\":{\"city\":\"Tokyo\"}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_018BwtUHv7ZJLFNgkk5U2htV\",\"content\":\"Tokyo: clear\\n25°C, wind 10 km/h\",\"is_error\":false}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"I'm working out the travel time for the train: dividing the 283 km distance by the 74 km/h speed gives about 3 hours 49 minutes, which I add to the 09:47 departure to land on an arrival of about 13:36.\\n\\n\",\"signature\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Tokyo is clear and 25°C, with wind at 10 km/h.\\n\\n**Train arrival:**\\n- Time = distance ÷ speed = 283 km ÷ 74 km/h ≈ 3.8243 h\\n- 0.8243 h × 60 ≈ 49.46 min, so the trip is about 3 h 49.46 min (3 h 49 min 28 s)\\n- 09:47 + 3 h 49 min 28 s = 13:36:28\\n\\nThe train arrives at **13:36**.\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Should I bring an umbrella? One word.\",\"cache_control\":{\"type\":\"ephemeral\"}}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}}],\"max_tokens\":128000,\"stream\":true,\"system\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"You are a weather assistant. Answer briefly.\\n\\n<addendum>\\nReference for pi-restore-anthropic-haiku-5-5-thinking: the weather desk's station catalog. Use it only when asked.\\n- Station 1: code WX001, elevation 0 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 2: code WX002, elevation 37 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 3: code WX003, elevation 74 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 4: code WX004, elevation 111 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 5: code WX005, elevation 148 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 6: code WX006, elevation 185 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 7: code WX007, elevation 222 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 8: code WX008, elevation 259 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 9: code WX009, elevation 296 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 10: code WX010, elevation 333 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 11: code WX011, elevation 370 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 12: code WX012, elevation 407 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 13: code WX013, elevation 444 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 14: code WX014, elevation 481 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 15: code WX015, elevation 518 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 16: code WX016, elevation 555 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 17: code WX017, elevation 592 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 18: code WX018, elevation 629 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 19: code WX019, elevation 666 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 20: code WX020, elevation 703 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 21: code WX021, elevation 740 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 22: code WX022, elevation 777 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 23: code WX023, elevation 814 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 24: code WX024, elevation 851 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 25: code WX025, elevation 888 